# UN1CA unica/debloat.sh plus target/r0q/debloat.sh.
# partition is the image root. The path is relative to that root.
# eSIM apps stay: r0q supports eSIM. fabric_crypto stays: UN1CA r0q is API 34.
# DiagMonAgent9 is the One UI 5.1 folder. UN1CA only names DiagMonAgent91.

